OL,3,GNEWSASchool review into abuse after
OL,4,Aex-pupil disclosures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boarding school has begun a review
OL,7,Finto historical abuse after a former
OL,8,Fteacher was jailed for the indecent
OL,9,Fassault of two pupils.
OL,11,FThe King's School Canterbury, in a
OL,12,Fletter to alumni seen by the BBC, wrote
OL,13,Fthat ex-pupils had "disclosed
OL,14,Fexperiences involving other former
OL,15,Fmembers of staff".
OL,17,FOthers had shared "further information"
OL,18,Fabout Dennis Fletcher, 76, from
OL,19,FBroadstairs, who was sentenced to 11
OL,20,Fyears and nine months in prison in July
OL,21,Ffor sexually abusing two boys under the
OL,22,Fage of 14 between 1978 and 1982.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
